Subject: Give the first account the groups KDOS gives its own

--- a/files/plasmasetuprc	2026-10-27 17:01:27.000000000 +0530
+++ b/files/plasmasetuprc	2026-11-01 17:49:55.018036366 +0530
@@ -19,4 +19,7 @@
 # Example: UserGroups=wheel,lp,kvm
 #
 # NOTE: Leaving this key empty results in the hard-coded default of "wheel".
-UserGroups=wheel
+#
+# KDOS: the groups the image gives its own account (fs/etc/group), so an
+# account made here can do what one the installer made can.
+UserGroups=wheel,users,audio,video,render,input,kvm,cdrom,dialout,lpadmin,tty
